<title>SINGAPORE: F&amp;N half year net profit down 18 pct.</title>
<headline>F&amp;N half year net profit down 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 83.54     vs	101.85</p>
<p>Dividend (cts)	    8.00     vs	  7.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	28.20     vs	 35.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		  149.96     vs	165.32</p>
<p>    Other income		3.80     vs	  4.63</p>
<p>    Interest expense	  0.69     vs	  3.33</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	    55.38     vs	 83.73</p>
<p>    Tax			  14.34     vs	 21.23</p>
<p>Dividend register/pay  July 4/July 16</p>
<p>Note - Fraser &amp; Neave Ltd is involved in the manufacture of drinks, beer and dairy products, packaging business, development and investment of property.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
